{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Cedar Shores</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the bustling city of Cedar Shores and build your future! Apply for a job at a local business, open your own shop, and uncover new opportunities around every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010030/extras/f9f9860dedfb00453831c316d533b50e.avif?t=1771359064\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Make Yourself at Home</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a variety of residences to make your own, from suburban houses to city apartments, and personalize every detail with your selection of furniture and finishes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010030/extras/241175751dc5cc02fb09f3bbd33e35d9.avif?t=1771359064\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Climb to the Top</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on new challenges, make connections, and shape your journey in a  world where your ambitions set the pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010030/extras/182a3142e51a2178adec860ab1b2a59e.avif?t=1771359064\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unwind in Style</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick out a new ride at a local car dealership, refresh your wardrobe, connect with friends, and relax after work at the casino, club, or in the comfort of your own home. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010030/extras/72e10de72a11020b36a8f1af564c5458.avif?t=1771359064\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step Into the Action</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore diverse activities from cooking and high-speed racing to DJing, fishing, and underground ventures. Pursue your passions and uncover new adventures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2010030/extras/e91efe2be8e8b0e2b1f72284ac28530a.avif?t=1771359064\" width=616 height=180 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Strider","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2010030/87e161fe73901fbacbeab92d00c9b49faa66ad53.jpg"},{"name":"Saucy!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2010030/46d8c32097190d60acd7621bee5d0b36f2229cf2.jpg"},{"name":"Entrepreneur","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2010030/cbcb87f87044ce3a83cb5d94441f2ee796279683.jpg"},{"name":"Piggy Bank","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2010030/b1fc61ab92058f8fd06f231d522eb6b84daf3d74.jpg"},{"name":"Chasing Paper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2010030/1ebc4aaa7df5c6751af9083e891bcf6c81c63f49.jpg"},{"name":"Big Earner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2010030/211a0f341dd5cf5df7337760c33043b7e14941ba.jpg"},{"name":"Millionaire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2010030/a12f9522e5ae755348ce71b1b96f1fbb07bcfd49.jpg"},{"name":"Locksmith","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2010030/d0aa67dfee7254cce451c8a60d19e86ed41cf637.jpg"},{"name":"All-nighter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2010030/f843819df2fc16c1236b29267f1691b44e15b8b9.jpg"},{"name":"Pallet Master","path":"https://cdn.akam